! Pop-out Icon Plugin

Add customizable pop-out icon effects to tiddlers for notifications, badges, or interactive elements.

!! Usage

Add a pop-out icon to any tiddler by setting these fields:

* `popout-icon` - The text/character to display (e.g., "!", "2", "★", "NEW")
* `popout-icon-size` - Size: "small", "medium" (default), or "large"
* `popout-icon-position` - Position: "top-right" (default), "top-left", "bottom-right", "bottom-left"
* `popout-icon-color` - Custom color (CSS color value)
* `popout-icon-animation` - Animation: "pulse" (default), "bounce", "rotate", or "none"
* `popout-icon-tooltip` - Tooltip text on hover
* `popout-icon-action` - Action type: "navigate", "popup", "message", or empty for none
* `popout-icon-action-target` - Target for the action (tiddler title, popup state, or message name)

!! Examples

Basic notification badge:
```
popout-icon: "2"
popout-icon-size: "small"
popout-icon-position: "top-right"
popout-icon-animation: "pulse"
```

Important tiddler indicator:
```
popout-icon: "!"
popout-icon-size: "medium"
popout-icon-color: "#ff6b6b"
popout-icon-tooltip: "Important"
```

Clickable navigation icon:
```
popout-icon: "→"
popout-icon-action: "navigate"
popout-icon-action-target: "Related Tiddler"
popout-icon-tooltip: "Go to related tiddler"
```

!! Widget Usage

You can also use the widget directly:

```
<$popout-icon 
	text="2"
	size="small"
	position="top-right"
	animation="pulse"
	tooltip="2 new items"
/>
```

!! Features

* Glass-fog styling matching A Wild Sort theme
* Multiple animation options
* Customizable size, position, and color
* Click actions (navigate, popup, message)
* Responsive and accessible
* Works in both dark and light modes


